#: addon\globalPlugins\brailleEssentials\addonhelp.py:49
msgid ""
"This window lists bindings that depend on your braille display profile and "
"the add-on’s keyboard assignments. Concepts, settings, and credits are in "
"the user guide—open User guide from the NVDA add-on store under help menu "
"item."
